+// ---- waitpeer: dependent waiters are not judged while their source is unresolved (SPEC2, 2026-10-27) ----
+// Element e(X, c, k): the (posted, polled) of X's QP to rank k in context c, with its own stall clock (the stall
+// definition above, the reader's gap rule included). Observer O, one snapshot of every rank's clocks:
+//   Z = {X : some element of X stalled >= T_z} (T_z = SUSPECT_MS - 2 x PROBE_MS, 1 800 ms); O's own row from a local read
